{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sluK0SUVhS1794791641.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本第三季度國內生產總值(GDP)不如市場預期，按年收縮百分之0.1。</p><p></p><p>市場原預測增長百分之0.3，更遠差於第二季度的百分之1.7增幅。按季計，第三季度零增長，市場預測增長百分之0.1。第二季增長百分之0.4。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T02:10:30.752925+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T01:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T09:49:23.708682+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T02:03:57.310892+00:00","content_hash":"d10cc76ef841644501218fd2e5accabb7be38ca88f2e2d12814605c49313e592","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T02:10:30.752925+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}